{"title":"Butterfly","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 3 Butterfly that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(71.1px,34.3px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-38.9px;top:-55.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-45.6px;top:-53.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-52.2px;top:-58.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-77.0px;top:-60.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-75.6px;top:-58.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-71.5px;top:-41.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-88.7px;top:-13.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:-88.0px;top:-13.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:-74.9px;top:7.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-82.5px;top:4.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:-92.1px;top:38.2px\"></i></div><figcaption>Orc Camp</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 15 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"butterfly\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Butterfly: <a href=\"#/monster/giant-butterfly\">Giant Butterfly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/59c0da2859c72de6299d.svg\" alt=\"Butterfly\"></div><h3>Butterfly</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>3 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 3–10)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Butterfly</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>16</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>3.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>22 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}